{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14108410","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14108410","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1410841001:0":{"text":"The Primordial Dragon is as big as a mountain.","source_cn":"初始之龙的身躯如山峦般巨大。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FF7227644C572FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1410841002:0":{"text":"If such a large creature would rise and fly into the air, what a sight that would be.","source_cn":"这样的庞然巨物一旦舒展身躯，腾空而起，那该是多么震撼的景象。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD036608F15B8BAD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410841003:0":{"text":"How could something so big fly in the air? It's completely against the laws of aerodynamics...","source_cn":"这么大，到底要怎么飞起来呢……根本不符合空气动力学——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88AAF29FB0E7A230","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1410841003":{"text":"How could something so big fly in the air? It's completely against the laws of aerodynamics...","source_cn":"这么大，到底要怎么飞起来呢……根本不符合空气动力学——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88AAF29FB0E7A230","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410841004:0":{"text":"Argh! I'm so tired of you magical people going against the natural order! One of these days...","source_cn":"哼，真烦你们这些有了魔法就不讲常理的家伙！早晚有一天……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7DE629E86D6DC7B9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Argh! I'm so tired of you magical people going against the natural order! One of these days...","female":"Argh! I'm so tired of you magical people going against the natural order! One of these days...","variant_male_record_index":"158876","variant_female_record_index":"158877","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410841005:0":{"text":"*Sigh* Never mind! Do you have a plan for the dragon?","source_cn":"先不提这个！你们有什么对付龙的方案吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4802A43DCC5136DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410841006:0":{"text":"Once this dragon wakes up, even a tiny yawn could set off a chain reaction of calamity. ","source_cn":"这头龙一旦醒过来，光是打个哈欠都能引发天灾。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x426EA572A7DFF183","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1410841006":{"text":"Once this dragon wakes up, even a tiny yawn could set off a chain reaction of calamity. ","source_cn":"这头龙一旦醒过来，光是打个哈欠都能引发天灾。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x426EA572A7DFF183","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410841007:0":{"text":"Are you serious? You've seen it before. It doesn't even leave a scratch.","source_cn":"认真的吗？你们也看到过，它只能听个响！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x906FB566EC70B2AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410841008:0":{"text":"That's just for the sleeping dragon, but once it wakes...","source_cn":"那只是对付沉睡的龙，如果龙醒了的话……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6B4C83FAD57577A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410841009:0":{"text":"Ohhh! I see what you mean. You're right; I shouldn't lose hope so soon.","source_cn":"好吧好吧！我也该对自己有点信心！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18BACD0B5385B40B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410841015:0":{"text":"At least we have the bare bones of a plan now.","source_cn":"这么看来，还是有点准备嘛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9DB9266B46B2B1C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410841016:0":{"text":"So, do dragons have any weaknesses?","source_cn":"那么龙呢？龙有什么弱点吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98460D3C768F849A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1410841016":{"text":"So, do dragons have any weaknesses?","source_cn":"那么龙呢？龙有什么弱点吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98460D3C768F849A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1410841017:0":{"text":"We'd already be burnt to a crisp by the time we meet its eyes!","source_cn":"……等看到眼睛的时候，我们就已经被烧焦了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7565BE86AF4E4EFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:0:1":{"text":"Their eyes.","source_cn":"眼睛","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x65863BF8B3E2D9F4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Their eyes.","female":"Their eyes.","variant_male_record_index":"71718","variant_female_record_index":"71719","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1410841018:0":{"text":"Is that really a weakness? It makes one move, and the whole place may cave in!","source_cn":"这真的是弱点吗？她随便动一下我们都得躲半天！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDFF9E2A4535F46B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1410841019:0":{"text":"I think what Merlin meant was that its movements would be limited.","source_cn":"我想，梅林的意思是龙的体型也会限制她的行动。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3D9F3B4ED9B31E35","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I think what Merlin meant was that its movements would be limited.","female":"I think what Merlin meant was that its movements would be limited.","variant_male_record_index":"158893","variant_female_record_index":"158894","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1410841020:0":{"text":"Especially in this area.","source_cn":"尤其是在这种特殊的空间里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0EAE21786500574","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:1:2":{"text":"Their bulkiness.","source_cn":"体型庞大","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x68A743EF3FE73F72","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Their bulkiness.","female":"Their bulkiness.","variant_male_record_index":"71720","variant_female_record_index":"71721","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1410841021:0":{"text":"Of course, we're ants to that thing!","source_cn":"确实，那家伙肯定对我们这些小生物看不上眼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21BD6C26E4AB08DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1410841022:0":{"text":"The moment she underestimates us is our chance to strike.","source_cn":"她轻敌之际，就是我们的机会。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3D1D346E6831279","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:2:3":{"text":"Its arrogance.","source_cn":"傲慢","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE31A4CDD8577482A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Its arrogance.","female":"Its arrogance.","variant_male_record_index":"71722","variant_female_record_index":"71723","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1410841023:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">Reverse scales</style>... Oh, I remember now!","source_cn":"<style=highlight>逆鳞</style>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7784E05A5F450C1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1410841024:0":{"text":"Legend has it that dragons have a scaly patch of reverse scales near their throat area.","source_cn":"传说中巨龙的头部以下咽喉处有一块逆生长的鳞片——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56DCE02C3779D66E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1410841025:0":{"text":"It's a dragon's only weak point.","source_cn":"那是龙唯一的要害。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B998993EB7E201F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1410841026:0":{"text":"If she won't listen to us, we'll just aim there.","source_cn":"万一……她根本不愿意听我们的辩解。就瞄准那里吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE25225DE1490DF7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1410841027:0":{"text":"Alright, I think I'm ready.","source_cn":"嗯，我想，我已经准备好了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5ACC1FE34DE5AA2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1410841028:0":{"text":"Along this path, I've wanted the truth to atone for my mistakes, to find a chance to change everything...","source_cn":"这一路走来，我想要知道真相，想要赎罪，想要寻找契机改变...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE6900967F7365C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1410841029:0":{"text":"But at the end of the day, I just want to show people that there is another possibility; that we Essail have the power to make another choice.","source_cn":"但最终，我只想为众人展现另一种可能性，让艾塞勒们拥有做...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87FD6925EED189BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1410841030:0":{"text":"The Primordial Dragon is no exception. She deserves to know the truth and make her own choice.","source_cn":"初始之龙也不例外。她应该知晓真相，做出自己的选择。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24CD0C9D07DBF20A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1410841031:0":{"text":"An indiscriminate attitude toward all, with an unwavering persistence toward a goal...","source_cn":"对一切事物都绝无分别的态度。对目标毫无动摇的执着……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CC55BC38F3F5BDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1410841032:0":{"text":"A determination as strong as a mountain, with a will as hot as a blazing inferno...","source_cn":"这份如山岩般坚定的决心，如烈火般灼热的意志……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA745A945C65999BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1410841033:0":{"text":"Indris, take up the Eclipsion, and don't let us down!","source_cn":"因度厄，拉开杜恩加尔吧！别让我们失望！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD368F419963B7A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:3:4":{"text":"Its reverse scales.","source_cn":"还有逆鳞","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4A7322E6F6BCBD3F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Its reverse scales.","female":"Its reverse scales.","variant_male_record_index":"71724","variant_female_record_index":"71725","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"We can use your new cannon.","source_cn":"你的炮台","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCBFDF94D7D2D6B61","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"We can use your new cannon.","female":"We can use your new cannon.","variant_male_record_index":"71712","variant_female_record_index":"71713","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1410841010:0":{"text":"It's not Indris' bow! That's the divine bow of the dwarves, the Eclipsion!","source_cn":"什么因度厄的弓？那是我们矮人的神弓——杜恩加尔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81D3AEF2C5EA9BB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1410841011:0":{"text":"He's just—borrowing it, okay?! Only the arrows are his!","source_cn":"呃……暂时借出去的！箭矢倒是可以算因度厄的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9319CCA140CE884D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1410841012:0":{"text":"Yes, the Eclipsion and my arrows...","source_cn":"嗯，杜恩加尔和我的箭矢。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB3545DADC9C6FC91","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Yes, the Eclipsion and my arrows...","female":"Yes, the Eclipsion and my arrows...","variant_male_record_index":"158885","variant_female_record_index":"158886","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:1:2":{"text":"How about Indris' new bow?","source_cn":"因度厄的弓箭","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7A0C1C286B966D24","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"How about Indris' new bow?","female":"How about Indris' new bow?","variant_male_record_index":"71714","variant_female_record_index":"71715","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1410841013:0":{"text":"That would help!","source_cn":"那可就全指望你了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DBC48D838E34C2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1410841014:0":{"text":"It'd be bad if the dragon turned us into barbecue skewers.","source_cn":"要是被龙喷成风干肉可就完蛋啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9F7709561328363","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:2:3":{"text":"What about my shield?","source_cn":"我的护盾","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB543C80CB0CAC1E0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What about my shield?","female":"What about my shield?","variant_male_record_index":"71716","variant_female_record_index":"71717","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:0:1":{"text":"It's magic.","source_cn":"这是魔法","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x88CC155B316BFE1C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It's magic.","female":"It's magic.","variant_male_record_index":"71710","variant_female_record_index":"71711","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"Indris","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"Zanie","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":45,"localized_text_count":44,"speaker_count":2}}